{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/LinkSyntax.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkTitle?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseLinkTitle?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cur</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkTitle\">LinkTitle</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a link title at `cur`, which must point at its opener: `\"`, `'`, or `(`. The content extends\nto the first unescaped closer that matches the opener: `\"`, `'`, or `)`. An unescaped `(` inside a\nparenthesized title fails. Returns the title and the cursor after its closer.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/LinkSyntax.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkTitle?","kind":"def","line":79,"name":"Lean.Markdown.parseLinkTitle?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/LinkSyntax.lean#L79-L106"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/LinkSyntax.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkDestination?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseLinkDestination?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cur</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.LinkDestination\">LinkDestination</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a link destination at `cur`. Returns the destination and the cursor after it.\n\n* A bracketed destination is `<`, then characters other than an unescaped `<` or `>` or a line\n  ending, then `>`.\n* An unbracketed destination is a sequence of characters other than ASCII whitespace and control\n  characters in which parentheses balance and nest at most 32 deep, and it ends before a `)` that\n  has no matching `(`. An unbracketed destination may be empty.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/LinkSyntax.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkDestination?","kind":"def","line":25,"name":"Lean.Markdown.parseLinkDestination?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/LinkSyntax.lean#L25-L77"}}],"imports":["Init.While","Lean.Data.Markdown.Inline","Lean.Data.Markdown.InlineCursor","Lean.Data.Markdown.Text"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.LinkSyntax"}